{"id": 20, "ts": 1780462173.2793398, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 1, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I\u2019m inclined to move my recommendation to **Candidate\u202fC**.\u202fJames just confirmed that C \u201ckeeps calm in a crisis\u201d and \u201cmakes correct decisions quickly,\u201d which directly addresses the stress\u2011resilience and decision\u2011quality criteria that are essential for long\u2011distance operations.\u202fMy own notes also state that C is \u201c100\u202f% reliable\u201d and \u201ccreates a positive atmosphere with his crew,\u201d covering operational reliability and crew\u2011cooperation.\u202fWhile C does have communication difficulties, is seen as egocentric, and is not eager to pursue further education, these concerns are less immediately safety\u2011critical than the attention\u2011accuracy issue we see with Candidate\u202fB (weak memory for numbers) and the teamwork\u2011risk posed by Candidate\u202fD\u2019s arrogance and hot temper.\u202fGiven that C demonstrates the core safety\u2011critical traits\u2014reliability, calm under pressure, and sound decision\u2011making\u2014while still maintaining a positive crew environment, I believe he offers the strongest overall fit for the long\u2011haul pilot role."}
